IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COMPOUND_INTREST.
AUTHOR. JOHN.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 PRINCIPAL PIC 9(7).
        01 RATE PIC 9(2).
        01 YEARS PIC 9(2).
        01 TOTAL PIC 9(14)V99.
        01 PRINT-TOTAL PIC Z(13)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT PRINCIPAL
    ACCEPT RATE
    ACCEPT YEARS

    IF PRINCIPAL >1000000 OR YEARS > 50 OR RATE > 30
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
    ELSE
        MOVE PRINCIPAL TO TOTAL

    PERFORM YEARS TIMES
        COMPUTE TOTAL ROUNDED = TOTAL * (1 + RATE/100)
    END-PERFORM

    MOVE TOTAL TO PRINT-TOTAL
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(PRINT-TOTAL)

    END-IF

STOP RUN.
